--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Note on the agent CLIs
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

runtrol supervises coding agent CLIs that the user has already installed, such
as Anthropic Claude Code and OpenAI Codex CLI. Those programs are not bundled,
vendored, modified, or redistributed here. runtrol spawns the official binary
as the user installed it, and each remains subject to its own license and terms
of service. runtrol never holds, forwards, or logs the credentials those
programs use.

